WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.794 --> 00:00:03.920
Hi Stillwater!

00:00:04.295 --> 00:00:05.004
Hi kids.

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:07.549
Addy,

00:00:07.549 --> 00:00:09.467
why don't we celebrate your race?

00:00:09.634 --> 00:00:10.552
I didn't win.

00:00:10.552 --> 00:00:12.971
Doing your best is reason to celebrate.

00:00:13.138 --> 00:00:14.222
Thank you Stillwater.

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:17.434
Looks like pet sitting is going well.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:18.393
Not really.

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:20.562
I really wanted her to like me best.

00:00:20.562 --> 00:00:22.439
Is that the most important part?

00:00:22.605 --> 00:00:24.983
No, I have to make sure she's safe and happy.

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:27.652
Guess I'm a pretty good pet sitter after all.

00:00:27.736 --> 00:00:29.738
And a pretty good brother as well.

00:00:32.073 --> 00:00:32.949
It's starting!

00:00:32.949 --> 00:00:33.992
The lunar eclipse.

00:00:33.992 --> 00:00:35.034
Wow.

00:00:36.661 --> 00:00:37.787
I made cupcakes!

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:38.872
Oh no!

00:00:39.122 --> 00:00:40.999
Thinking of things a different way

00:00:40.999 --> 00:00:41.708
is good.

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:44.252
This time we'll try something different.

00:00:44.794 --> 00:00:45.420
Sprinkles!

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:46.796
Good idea Addy.

00:00:47.839 --> 00:00:48.339
Go!

00:00:48.965 --> 00:00:50.550
Only those who try...

00:00:50.633 --> 00:00:51.509
Like this.

00:00:51.509 --> 00:00:53.219
...can achieve the impossible.

00:00:55.054 --> 00:00:56.473
Very impressive.

00:00:56.556 --> 00:00:57.599
We love your stories.

